   "source": [
    "Separate the features (X) from the target (y). `Id` is just a row number, so it's dropped along with the target itself."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "X = df.drop(['Id', 'SalePrice'], axis=1)\n",
    "y = df['SalePrice']"
